For an open organ pipe, the length of the pipe with end correction is given as:
$\begin{aligned}
& \mathrm{L}=l+2 \mathrm{e}=l+2 \times 0.6 \mathrm{r} \ldots(\because \mathrm{e}=0.6 \mathrm{r} \text { for open pipe }) \\
